{"source": "mrds", "article_key": "193877", "url": "https://www.mrds66.com/archives/193877/", "title": "日本成人漫画图集 正如我们共同谱写的故事那般 姐姐和妹妹炽热的感情 延续回忆的日记本", "published_at": "2026-09-18", "html": "<div class=\"post-content\" itemprop=\"articleBody\">\n<p>小西天出不了真大圣，禁漫里却来了个藤本树。他用爱与死亡编织成艺术品，让爆火的纯爱禁漫如同一场共同谱写的故事。你只需轻声一句“纯爱”，我便心甘情愿地看了一遍又一遍。那些细腻的情感、沉重的别离与温柔的纠缠，在黑白的画面里反复回响，成为我们心中无法替代的篇章。</p><p>关键词：#每日大赛 #日本 #成人漫画 #漫画 #图集 #正如我们共同谱写的故事那般 #禁漫</p><p><strong>热门大赛</strong></p> \n <div class=\"tags\">\n<div class=\"keywords YkziYC\" itemprop=\"keywords\"><a href=\"/tag/%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC/\">日本</a><a href=\"/tag/%E6%BC%AB%E7%94%BB/\">漫画</a><a href=\"/tag/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E5%A4%A7%E8%B5%9B/\">每日大赛</a><a href=\"/tag/%E5%9B%BE%E9%9B%86/\">图集</a><a href=\"/tag/%E7%A6%81%E6%BC%AB/\">禁漫</a><a href=\"/tag/%E6%88%90%E4%BA%BA%E6%BC%AB%E7%94%BB/\">成人漫画</a><a href=\"/tag/%E5%B0%8F%E8%A5%BF%E5%A4%A9%E5%87%BA%E4%B8%8D%E4%BA%86%E7%9C%9F%E5%A4%A7%E5%9C%A3/\">小西天出不了真大圣</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"article-download\">\n<div class=\"btn\">\n<a href=\"https://07457.muokmlaw.cc\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer external\" target=\"_blank\">\n      下载每日大赛 APP，视频可收藏点赞，还有社区大赛等你\n    </a>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>", "images": [{"source_url": "https://pic.ndhixj.cn/upload_01/xiao/20260918/2026091820145120669.jpeg", "key": "mrds/193877/img-62534204f7f2.jpg"}, {"source_url": "https://pic.ndhixj.cn/upload_01/xiao/20260918/2026091820145268927.jpeg", "key": "mrds/193877/img-8fb3825c8256.jpg"}, {"source_url": "https://pic.ndhixj.cn/upload_01/xiao/20260918/2026091820145414893.jpeg", "key": "mrds/193877/img-d40a59fdc68c.jpg"}, {"source_url": "https://pic.ndhixj.cn/upload_01/xiao/20260918/2026091820145759346.jpeg", "key": "mrds/193877/img-316b116f5770.jpg"}, {"source_url": "https://pic.ndhixj.cn/upload_01/xiao/20260918/2026091820145976767.jpeg", "key": "mrds/193877/img-135478841d57.jpg"}, {"source_url": "https://pic.ndhixj.cn/upload_01/xiao/20260918/2026091820150125079.jpeg", "key": "mrds/193877/img-d6c3436817cc.jpg